ll,["zh-Hant"],[["這是我目前在台北吃過最喜歡的二郎拉麵之一。\n蒜頭、背脂、豆芽菜和鹹度的份量都可以做調整。鹹度如果不習慣吃重口味建議先選普通，我自己是偏好濃一點的，最濃吃過一次但吃到後面會有點太膩所以不太推薦。\n每次去吃都能吃得相當飽足、滿意和爽快，我很中意這裡的拌麵，麵條很好地吸附了湯汁且吃起來很有彈性。\n店員會在用餐完關心你有沒有吃飽相當有趣。\n唯一的缺點就是人實在太多了，想不排隊吃到可能要挑一些冷門的時段或碰碰運氣。",null,[0,145]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaTTFwWWJHbFRTR1JoVm10b1FsSnJNVk5hZW1oRllVaGFUV0pWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,10507,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZM1pYbGlTSGRhVmtoQlJrMVNaemhFYUhaTWJVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7623ec854cb36b50!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlY3ZXliSHdaVkhBRk1SZzhEaHZMbUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZM1pYbGlTSGRhVmtoQlJrMVNaemhFYUhaTWJVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZM1pYbGlTSGRhVmtoQlJrMVNaemhFYUhaTWJVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZM1pYbGlTSGRhVmtoQlJrMVNaemhFYUhaTWJVRRILMGUtN0NpUFhoSEYaPgovQ